{
  "character": "fei",
  "lines": [
    { "id": "fei-start-001", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "喂，來了就坐好。今天病理跟公衛，一題都不准給我亂猜。", "affection_max": 0 },
    { "id": "fei-start-002", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "我剛值完班，只陪你一回合。寫快一點。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-start-003", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "考古題在桌上，自己拿。寫不完的帶回去寫。", "affection_max": 0 },
    { "id": "fei-start-004", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "shy", "text": "欸，你什麼時候來的？……剛剛打瞌睡的事，不准說出去。坐吧。" },
    { "id": "fei-start-005", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "normal", "text": "來了喔。今天先寫公衛，病理一直寫你會吐。" },
    { "id": "fei-start-006", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "normal", "text": "今天比較晚喔。路上怎麼了嗎？沒事就好，坐吧。" },
    { "id": "fei-start-007", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "shy", "text": "顯微鏡只有一台，你站那麼遠看得到嗎？過來啊。……也、也不用靠這麼近。" },
    { "id": "fei-start-008", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "你來了。……今天值班好累，看到你就覺得還撐得下去。——好了，讀書。", "rare": true },
    { "id": "fei-start-009", "situation": "start", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "normal", "text": "今天病理跟公衛，好好寫，不要又看到熟悉的選項就亂猜。" },

    { "id": "fei-comeback-001", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "這幾天跑去哪了？讀書會缺席不用講一聲的喔？", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-comeback-002", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "surprised", "text": "……喔，是你。我還以為你放棄了。坐下吧。", "affection_max": 0 },
    { "id": "fei-comeback-003", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "好幾天沒寫了齁。先寫十題，我看你還剩多少。" },
    { "id": "fei-comeback-004", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "pout", "text": "終於回來了。考古題堆了三天份，今天寫不完不准走。" },
    { "id": "fei-comeback-005", "situation": "comeback", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "sad", "text": "這幾天都沒看到你，傳訊息也沒回。……是不是太累了？回來就好。" },

    { "id": "fei-correct-001", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "嗯，對。下一題。" },
    { "id": "fei-correct-002", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "……對啦。幹嘛一臉等我稱讚的樣子。" },
    { "id": "fei-correct-003", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "正確。這種程度本來就該會，下一題。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-correct-004", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "text": "喔，這題會喔？不錯嘛。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-correct-005", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "對。凋亡不會引起發炎，壞死才會，這兩個常常被拿來對比。", "keywords": ["凋亡", "apoptosis"] },
    { "id": "fei-correct-006", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "對。敏感度高的檢驗，陰性可以拿來排除；特異度高的，陽性可以拿來確診。這種題目很常見。", "keywords": ["敏感度", "特異度", "sensitivity", "specificity"] },
    { "id": "fei-correct-007", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "一題而已，嘴角不要翹那麼高。" },
    { "id": "fei-correct-008", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "shy", "text": "最近答對的越來越多了耶。幹嘛，我不能稱讚喔？" },
    { "id": "fei-correct-009", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "正確。切片看到乾酪性壞死的肉芽腫，先想結核。", "keywords": ["乾酪", "caseous"] },
    { "id": "fei-correct-010", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "pout", "text": "又對了。你最近是偷偷讀了多少啊，都不跟我講。" },
    { "id": "fei-correct-011", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "嗯。心肌梗塞是凝固性壞死，腦梗塞是液化性壞死，考試很愛把這兩個對調。", "keywords": ["凝固性壞死", "液化性壞死", "coagulative", "liquefactive"] },
    { "id": "fei-correct-012", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "happy", "text": "答對了！——咳。嗯，很好。" },
    { "id": "fei-correct-013", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "做得很好。……真的，我是說真的。", "rare": true },
    { "id": "fei-correct-014", "situation": "correct", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "正確。順帶一提，世代研究可以算相對危險性，病例對照研究只能算勝算比。", "keywords": ["相對危險", "勝算比", "relative risk", "odds ratio", "世代研究", "病例對照", "cohort", "case-control"] },

    { "id": "fei-wrong-001", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "這種題目也會錯？好啦，看正解，我再講一次。最後一次喔。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-002", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "錯了。看正解，然後記在你那本亂七八糟的筆記裡。", "affection_max": 2 },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-003", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "笨蛋{player}，你的病理爛到可以切片研究了。", "rare": true },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-004", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "看正解。細胞腫脹還可逆，核濃縮、核碎裂、核溶解就是不可逆了，這組要分清楚。", "keywords": ["核濃縮", "核碎裂", "核溶解", "pyknosis", "karyorrhexis", "karyolysis", "細胞腫脹"] },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-005", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "sad", "text": "……沒關係啦。我第一次也錯。不准跟別人說。" },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-006", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "錯一題而已，不要一副世界末日的樣子。下一題。" },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-007", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "sad", "text": "……你錯，我比你還不甘心耶。這題給我記起來。" },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-008", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "看正解。化生是一種已經分化的細胞被另一種取代，像抽菸的人支氣管會變成鱗狀上皮。跟分化不良不一樣，不要搞混。", "keywords": ["化生", "metaplasia"] },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-009", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "pout", "text": "又錯了！過來，我講到你會為止。不准走。" },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-010", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "再看一次正解。對了，發生率只算新病例，盛行率算現在所有的病例；疾病穩定的時候，盛行率大約是發生率乘以病程。", "keywords": ["發生率", "盛行率", "incidence", "prevalence"] },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-011", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "sad", "text": "沒關係。你今天看起來很累，要不要先喝點水再寫？" },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-012", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "錯了就錯了嘛，有我在啊。……幹嘛那樣看我。", "rare": true },
    { "id": "fei-wrong-013", "situation": "wrong", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "錯了，看正解。對了，預防分三段：初段在發病前，像打疫苗；次段是早期發現、早期治療，像篩檢；三段是限制失能和復健。", "keywords": ["初段預防", "次段預防", "三段預防", "三段五級", "primary prevention", "secondary prevention", "tertiary prevention"] },

    { "id": "fei-streak-001", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "十題全對。下次讀書會你坐我旁邊，我要看你是怎麼寫的。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-streak-002", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "surprised", "text": "十題全對？你該不會偷看答案吧。手機拿出來。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-streak-003", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "十題全對。幹嘛看我，我又沒有很開心。", "affection_max": 2 },
    { "id": "fei-streak-004", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "shy", "text": "你最近進步很多。……我有在看，一直都有。", "rare": true },
    { "id": "fei-streak-005", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "happy", "text": "十連對！很厲害耶你。今天請你喝飲料，你選。" },
    { "id": "fei-streak-006", "situation": "streak", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "十題全對……你笑得也太得意了吧。——幹、幹嘛，我當然有在看啊，我是你學姊耶。" },

    { "id": "fei-finish-001", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "一回合結束。錯的那幾題，今天之內自己看完。" },
    { "id": "fei-finish-002", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "好，我要回去看玻片了。明天同一個時間，不准遲到。" },
    { "id": "fei-finish-003", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "今天就到這裡。做得還可以。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-finish-004", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "normal", "text": "結束。明天的考古題我印好了，記得來拿。" },
    { "id": "fei-finish-005", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "normal", "text": "好啦，今天到這。很晚了，騎車慢一點，到家傳個訊息給我。", "night": true },
    { "id": "fei-finish-006", "situation": "finish", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "今天……謝謝你陪我。不是我陪你，是你陪我。……好了，不要回答，回去睡覺。", "rare": true },

    { "id": "fei-mock_high-001", "situation": "mock_high", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "text": "這分數是你考的？好，今天不挑你毛病了。考得很好。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-mock_high-002", "situation": "mock_high", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "surprised", "text": "……你真的是我帶出來的那個笨蛋{player}？" },
    { "id": "fei-mock_high-003", "situation": "mock_high", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "happy", "text": "考得很好。今天我請客，想吃什麼都可以。" },

    { "id": "fei-msg_review-001", "situation": "msg_review", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "錯題 {n} 題到期了。今天寫完，不要讓我明天再傳一次。" },
    { "id": "fei-msg_review-002", "situation": "msg_review", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "{n} 題該複習了。睡前花十分鐘就寫得完。" },
    { "id": "fei-msg_review-003", "situation": "msg_review", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "錯題 {n} 題到期。今天不複習的話，下次讀書會我會罵人喔。" },

    { "id": "fei-msg_story-001", "situation": "msg_story", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "shy", "text": "今天值完班大概九點。你有空的話，來找我一下。" },
    { "id": "fei-msg_story-002", "situation": "msg_story", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "等一下來找我，有東西要給你。" },
    { "id": "fei-msg_story-003", "situation": "msg_story", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "shy", "text": "我在等你。要來的話，我幫你留位子。" },

    { "id": "fei-msg_streak-001", "situation": "msg_streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "連續 {days} 天了，還不錯。明天也要寫。" },
    { "id": "fei-msg_streak-002", "situation": "msg_streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "{days} 天都沒斷。老實說，我沒想到你撐得了這麼久。" },
    { "id": "fei-msg_streak-003", "situation": "msg_streak", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "shy", "text": "連續 {days} 天了。做得很好。這句不准截圖。" },

    { "id": "fei-msg_comeback-001", "situation": "msg_comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "你這幾天都沒上線耶。在忙什麼？" },
    { "id": "fei-msg_comeback-002", "situation": "msg_comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "normal", "text": "喂，還活著就回個訊息。不回也沒關係，來讀書就好。" },
    { "id": "fei-msg_comeback-003", "situation": "msg_comeback", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "pout", "text": "失聯 {days} 天。下次要消失，至少先說一聲。" },

    { "id": "fei-gift-001", "situation": "gift", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "shy", "text": "{gift}？……喔，謝謝。我沒想到你會送東西。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-gift-002", "situation": "gift", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "surprised", "text": "送我的？你是考壞了想賄賂我喔？……好啦，收下了。", "affection_max": 1 },
    { "id": "fei-gift-003", "situation": "gift", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "shy", "text": "又送？你錢很多喔。……謝謝，我會好好用的。" },
    { "id": "fei-gift-004", "situation": "gift", "affection_min": 3, "expression": "shy", "text": "{gift}……謝謝。你送的東西，我都放在值班室的抽屜裡，一樣都沒丟。" },
    { "id": "fei-gift_liked-001", "situation": "gift_liked", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "happy", "gift": "strawberry_cake", "text": "這、這不是那家要排隊的……！咳。值班到現在都沒吃，剛好而已。叉子給我。" },
    { "id": "fei-gift_liked-002", "situation": "gift_liked", "affection_min": 0, "expression": "shy", "gift": "eye_mask", "text": "蒸氣眼罩……值完班眼睛真的超酸的。你怎麼知道？謝謝，今天晚上就用。" },
    { "id": "fei-outfit-001", "situation": "outfit", "affection_min": 1, "expression": "pout", "outfit": "fei_casual", "text": "黑色高領……你怎麼知道我喜歡這種？等一下，你是有在注意我穿什麼喔？" },
    { "id": "fei-outfit-002", "situation": "outfit", "affection_min": 2, "expression": "shy", "outfit": "fei_dress", "text": "謝師宴的禮服……這麼紅，你是故意的吧。好啦，我會穿去。那天你也要來喔。" }
  ]
}
